{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness6Li","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.Witness6Li","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing"],"declarations":5,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.color_6li","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.color_6li","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness6Li.lean#L24-L28","doc":"Color content: Σ_{ℓ≥2} net(ℓ) — the degree ≥ 1 interaction content.\nThis is the \"M\" in the CMB analogy — the multi-body correlations\nthat the transfer matrix cannot capture per-generator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.observable_6li","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.observable_6li","kind":"def","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness6Li.lean#L19-L22","doc":"Observable amplitude: net(0) + net(1) — the optimal basis.\nDegree 0 + 1 content of the Gröbner NF. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.F_Pauli_6li_denom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.F_Pauli_6li_denom","kind":"def","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness6Li.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.net_6li","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.net_6li","kind":"def","line":14,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness6Li.lean#L14-L15","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.tr_alt_6li","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.PauliWitness.tr_alt_6li","kind":"def","line":6,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/PauliWitness/Witness6Li.lean#L6-L12","doc":"F_Pauli for 6Li (Z=3, N=3, A=6), exact in t = q^{1/2}.\nComputed by hecke-engine 0.8.0, 3ms.\nF_Pauli(q₀) = 0.4723621351\nDenominator: 2^9. ","signatureChunk":0}]}